    "title": "Representative Causer honors Mahlon and Sylvia Davenport for 70th wedding anniversary - Northern Tier News",
    "text": "Mahlon and Sylvia Davenport of Port Allegany marked their 70th wedding anniversary on Tuesday, February 10. To commemorate the occasion, Representative Martin Causer (R-Cameron/McKean/Potter) presented them with a citation from the Pennsylvania House of Representatives. The Davenports have three children, six grandchildren, and thirteen great-grandchildren.",
